publish with legacy - origin-price/origin-time fields) when applicable, with no subsequent writer before C; control reaches the publish site on the S5 path with no halt-state gate: the L5442 guard `if(sl41_halt == "-")` closes at L5484 (ORIGINCAND L5444-L5484 inside; SLEXT481 assembly L5485-L5493 and publish L5494-L5497 outside it, all inside the enclosing L5305 `if(InpDebugLog)` block); publish site L5494-L5497 quoted here: LwAudit("SLEXT481", sl41_line) + Print(sl41_line) + `g_sl41_def = sl41_def; g_sl41_px = sl41_px; g_sl41_slot = sl41_slot;` + `g_sl41_bt = sl41_bt; g_sl41_imb = sl41_imb; g_sl41_deep = sl41_deep;`; interior L5444-L5484 is ORIGINCAND diagnostic emission inside the guard while L5485-L5493 is the SLEXT481 assembly outside it); STAGE-1 proves reach unconditional on the S5 path within the L5305 debug gate, whose effective value is asserted pre-run (no-earlier-return census over ComputeSlReference L5291-L5494; the no-earlier-return census is the proof); the full L5442-L5498 block is pasted whole in the relay evidence; the L5494-L5495 SLEXT481 emission sits inside the L5305 `if(InpDebugLog)` block (brace L5306-L5498, machine brace census filed from the tree: L5306 opens depth 2; L5442 guard if at depth 2; L5443 opens depth 3; L5447 opens depth 4; L5449 opens depth 5 with L5454 closing to 4; L5455 else at depth 4 with L5456 opening depth 5; L5482 closes to 4; L5483 closes to 3; L5484 closes the halt guard back to 2; L5485-L5497 run at depth 2; L5498 closes the debug gate to depth 1), so corroboration rows exist iff the effective diagnostic input is true (manifest in P038); the S5-path live call is ComputeSlReference(barShift, g_dir, slRef, slMode, "S5") at EA L8779 inside `void EvaluateClosedBar` — STAGE-1 cites the full invocation census (L5291 declaration; ComputeSlReference invocations at L6152 inside `bool SlRefMemo` (EA L6067) and L8779 S5; L7271 comment-only; SlRefMemo call sites L7273 S2POLL + L8406 S3ARM, none in L8779→L9670) plus proof that L877