InpDebugLog=true (pre-run assertion) plus archive/run equivalence plus the 165-site global debug-input census plus the single offline equality ladOriginStamp==barTime, with the offline ordered-occurrence triple-join (site equality required) as second falsifier; halt-state rows join-halt (freshness only); s0/s1 slots+prices post-cast; entryPx==currentPrice textual equality required per row (free check, never a falsifier); ladOriginPx==currentPrice bit-equality mandatory per row (distinct symbols, real check); tpPx/entryPx mappings confirmed here (tpPx prints tpTarget, entryPx prints currentPrice); identifiers from closed enum sets with exact strings filed; carries; rawNum/rawDen exposure; R-form record; ordering/site mapping for L10073/L10170/L7682 — cite the distinct diagnostic rows or strike that sub-clause BEFORE build, never spend the run on it); single-construction assertion (one ordered key array plus one ordered value array consumed by both SCHEMA (keys only) and NORMAL (keys+values in matching indices) — single definition site asserted); construction-order assertion (terminal checks, cap-exhaustion, bSaved selector, reservation-in-branch, THEN constant-only prefill (initialization only), THEN key array, THEN SCHEMA-from-keys, THEN common serialization plus branch-local shadow computation interleaved with branch value stores, THEN NORMAL-from-pairs — no value position is stored before its own operand is computed (constant-only prefill excepted)); canonical-format assertion (%.17g candidate confirmed + sample-grammar validation over exponent/negative-zero/boundary cases plus a filed 24-char boundary token (-1.2345678901234567e-308, 24 chars under %.17g) alongside the filed -1e308 price-carry token (7 chars under %.17g, kept as the poison-carry case, never the width-boundary case) + full sample NORMAL parse-back field-for-field + all four record types validated against the frozen templates + staged readback per the P036 rule (synthetic fixtures from the script l